# 0_build_panel_from_excel.R --------------------------------------------------------------
# Build nol_panel.csv directly from the OCE "Standard Projection Equity Ratio Model" workbooks.
# Reads one tab per model year (default "OCE Adverse"), finds every row by its label (not by row
# number, which drifts between years), takes the base column plus the eleven projected columns,
# converts to the panel's units and sign conventions, and checks the accounting identities.
#
# Base R only: the workbook is unzipped and its XML parsed with regular expressions. If readxl
# happens to be installed it is used instead (same result). Nothing else is required.
#
# Standalone: set the paths in block 0, run blocks 1-3 (functions), then block 4 builds the adverse and
# severely-adverse panels and writes them. Nothing else is read.

